---
import SectionIndex from '~/components/ui/SectionIndex.astro';
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 pt-8 pb-16 sm:px-6 md:pt-12 md:pb-20 lg:px-8">
  <div class="border-t border-rule pt-8 sm:pt-10">
    <div class="grid gap-x-10 gap-y-6 md:grid-cols-[6.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)]">
      <SectionIndex index="01" label="about" />

      <div class="md:pt-2">
        <!-- $ whoami → the greeting is its "output". Typed prompts are inline
             terminal texture, not a windowed app, so the hero sits in the same
             editorial system as the other sections. -->
        <p class="font-mono text-sm text-ink-3">
          <span class="select-none" aria-hidden="true">$ </span><span
            class="cmd"
            style="--w:6ch;--steps:6;--delay:0.15s;--dur:0.5s">whoami</span
          >
        </p>

        <h1
          class="reveal mt-3 text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl"
          style="--delay:0.75s"
        >
          hi, i'm jeffery <span aria-hidden="true" class="motion-safe:animate-wave origin-[70%_70%] inline-block"
            >👋</span
          >
        </h1>

        <p class="mt-8 font-mono text-sm text-ink-3">
          <span class="select-none" aria-hidden="true">$ </span><span
            class="cmd"
            style="--w:12ch;--steps:12;--delay:1.05s;--dur:0.6s">cat about.md</span
          >
        </p>

        <div class="mt-4 max-w-2xl space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink sm:space-y-6 sm:text-lg">
          <p class="reveal" style="--delay:1.75s">
            i'm a software engineer in Accra, happiest in the parts nobody notices — the infrastructure, pipelines, and
            unglamorous plumbing that quietly keep everything people actually use running.
          </p>

          <p class="reveal" style="--delay:1.95s">
            day-to-day that's DevOps at Adaptive Computer Solutions: CI/CD, Kubernetes, observability — keeping
            production calm and quietly boring.
          </p>

          <p class="reveal" style="--delay:2.15s">
            my degree is in metallurgical engineering from KNUST. software was a back-door entry — i taught myself after
            graduation, and turned out to be a fast learner with a stubborn appetite for figuring things out.
          </p>

          <p class="reveal" style="--delay:2.35s">
            at night i'm picking up Ruby on Rails, exploring Pulumi, and getting deeper into LLMs. in my downtime:
            movies, anime, Gospel music, and the occasional acoustic guitar.
          </p>
        </div>

        <p class="reveal mt-8 font-mono text-sm text-ink-3" style="--delay:2.55s" aria-hidden="true">
          $ <span class="caret inline-block h-[1.1em] w-[0.55em] translate-y-[0.15em] bg-ink"></span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Typed commands and revealed lines are fully visible by default — only the
     animations below are conditional, so the page reads correctly with motion
     off or JS disabled. */
  .cmd {
    display: inline-block;
    overflow: hidden;
    white-space: nowrap;
    vertical-align: bottom;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .cmd {
      width: 0;
      animation: type var(--dur) steps(var(--steps), end) var(--delay) both;
    }

    /* .reveal is global (tailwind.css) — shared with the inner pages. */

    .caret {
      animation: blink 1.1s step-end infinite;
    }

    @keyframes type {
      to {
        width: var(--w);
      }
    }

    @keyframes blink {
      0%,
      50% {
        opacity: 1;
      }
      50.01%,
      100% {
        opacity: 0;
      }
    }
  }
</style>
